cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite the
  conference paper below.
title: "K230 TFLM Runner: RVV-accelerated TinyML benchmarks on the Kendryte K230"
abstract: >-
  Build system, toolchain setup, and MLPerf Tiny benchmark harness for running
  TensorFlow Lite Micro on the Kendryte K230, with hand-written RISC-V Vector
  (RVV) kernels. Reproduction artifact for the TELFOR 2025 paper "TinyML
  Unleashed".
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://gitlab.iti.uni-luebeck.de/mahmoudi/k230-tflmicro-runner"
keywords:
  - TinyML
  - RISC-V
  - RVV
  - vector extension
  - TensorFlow Lite Micro
  - Kendryte K230
  - MLPerf Tiny
